-> start

=== start ===
We were at the foot of the cross. Just another execution. We cast lots for his clothes, as is our custom.
* [Did anything unusual happen?] -> darkness

=== darkness ===
From noon until three, darkness came over the whole land. It was unnatural. Not a cloud, just... darkness. Then the earth shook.
* [What did the centurion say?] -> centurion

=== centurion ===
When the centurion saw the earthquake and all that had happened, he was terrified, and exclaimed, "Surely he was the Son of God!" I've never seen him like that.
-> DONE